#!/bin/sh
# nnn-opener — NNN_OPENER for nnn. Text/code opens in nvim (same terminal,
# returns to nnn on quit); images/video/audio open in imv/mpv in the
# background so nnn keeps control of the terminal.
for f in "$@"; do
    case "$f" in
        *.png|*.jpg|*.jpeg|*.gif|*.webp|*.bmp|*.svg|*.ico|*.tif|*.tiff)
            nohup imv "$f" >/dev/null 2>&1 &
            ;;
        *.mp4|*.mkv|*.webm|*.avi|*.mov|*.mp3|*.flac|*.ogg|*.wav|*.m4a|*.opus)
            nohup mpv "$f" >/dev/null 2>&1 &
            ;;
        *)
            nvim "$f"
            ;;
    esac
done
